          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തോട്ടം — tōṭṭaṁ — \"a plantation; a garden\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മലയിൽ വലിയ തേയിലത്തോട്ടങ്ങൾ ഉണ്ട്. malayil valiya tēyilattōṭṭaṅṅaḷ uṇṭŭ. There are big tea plantations in the hills."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: തോട്ടങ്ങൾ, tōṭṭaṅṅaḷ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You met it in പൂന്തോട്ടം, a flower garden."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തോട്ടം (tōṭṭaṁ) is native Dravidian, \"a garden\", from a root that means to dig (DEDR 3549)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
